<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:04Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>黃仁勳曾告訴我，那些關於中國與國家安全的問題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T02:41:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad--d34e970c53e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳正因涉嫌與一名中國間諜出軌而接受調查，他對世界秩序的未來遠比其他科技巨頭老闆重要得多。</summary></entry><entry><title>從局長下台到議會「沉默」 宏福苑大火後的政治問責與維穩邏輯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:52Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T01:03:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad--126982746c97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文採訪多名政治分析人士，拆解這場善後操作背後所反映的維穩管治邏輯，以及又與即將舉行的選委會及特首選舉有何深層連結。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國美軍在用基地反恐案件：華府稱三伊朗關聯者策劃</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx20xpn40zyo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T03:12:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx20xpn40zyo/trad--e0f8d9e2386f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx20xpn40zyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國司法部表示，這些男子涉及一連串陰謀，包括發生在英國空軍基地附近的一宗重大事件；該基地供美軍使用。</summary></entry><entry><title>一名公務員如何長期瞞天過海，身兼五職？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c933x388j116o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T00:21:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c933x388j116o/trad--76962c4bbdfe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c933x388j116o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">卡西姆·喬杜里（Kashim Chowdhury）在三年內將納稅人的錢挪用28.4萬英鎊後，被判犯有欺詐罪。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何晚上睡前總是想吃零食？可以怎麼辦？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly3ynk2rx1o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:01Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T00:21:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly3ynk2rx1o/trad--643bd2c058f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly3ynk2rx1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">你在睡前吃甜食是有生物學原因的，但你可以改變這個習慣。</summary></entry><entry><title>四成「陸配」參選遭剔除，身分「法理死結」如何困住參政之路？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T04:37:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad--f1b3d90e30e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「除籍滿10年」如何計算，成為這屆選舉多位陸配被剔除參選資格的爭議焦點。今年有25位「陸配」參選，當中逾4成參選人不符參選資格。</summary></entry><entry><title>「政二代」蘇巧慧對決「專業副手」李四川，誰能拿下新北？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T11:31:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad--d30d3a72b78c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">作為全台人口最多的直轄市，新北市被視為「最關鍵戰場」，將判定藍綠整體勝負，並可能牽動2028年總統大選。</summary></entry><entry><title>「九合一」五大看點：「洋流」能否撼動台北？誰在卡位2028？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T02:45:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad--4fc64a9bc6d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共是否介入台灣選舉？ 這次選舉將如何影響賴清德與國民黨主席鄭麗文的政治能量？捲土重來、希望藉著地方議員選舉有所斬獲的小黨，此次結盟能否在主流政黨夾殺中突圍而出？</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣「北藍南綠」的政治版圖是否「鐵板一塊」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:36:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad--e4c721debfd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「北藍南綠」是描述台灣政治版圖的常見概念，但近年選舉結果顯示，這樣的區域分野並非一成不變，中間選民的流向在這次地方選舉可能左右大局。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳婚外情：被指為「中共間諜」的黃樂是誰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjr4y41lv6zko/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T08:24:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjr4y41lv6zko/trad--25e0cde54af2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjr4y41lv6zko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達黃仁勳承認對妻子不忠，緋聞鎖定被指中共間諜的黃樂。這位女子曾任新加坡科技公司高管，大量採購輝達晶片，美情報稱她受國安部招募。但特朗普（川普）為黃仁勳辯護，中方则否认指控。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳婚外情風波將在全球引發連鎖反應</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63eled4384zo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T04:02:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63eled4384zo/trad--005b6a5f2cdd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63eled4384zo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳因與一名被指控為中國間諜的女子有婚外情，正受到其所在公司的調查。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳婚外情掀起國安風暴：拆解五大看點</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmym2gg9z1o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T13:10:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmym2gg9z1o/trad--9898963bb974.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmym2gg9z1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達（英偉達）總裁黃仁勳承認婚外情並向公眾致歉，為何引發國安及輿論風暴？新加坡的角色又是如何？會影響台灣的產業鏈嗎？中國為何嚴厲否認相關指控。</summary></entry><entry><title>全球最大排放國的拐點：中國煤電佔比跌破五成，碳排放幾乎停滯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxnv0vgpj0qpo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:09:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxnv0vgpj0qpo/trad--95892e97c1d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxnv0vgpj0qpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析指排放或已提前達峰，但新煤電機組仍大量上馬，拐點成色有待檢驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國笑匠布蘭德強姦案判刑 為何BBC和貝安德均作表態？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0yemem08o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T11:58:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0yemem08o/trad--fbb36be1db22.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0yemem08o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這名聲名狼藉的藝人被判監禁十年半。英國首相貝安德表示，十年前曾與這名喜劇演員交往的工黨政治人物當時並不知道他的罪行。</summary></entry><entry><title>白金漢宮幕僚：英王查爾斯「會考慮訪華」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj20v0x3ze2no/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T16:31:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj20v0x3ze2no/trad--c76740f3078b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj20v0x3ze2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白金漢宮一名幕僚表示，若貝安德首相向王室提議查爾斯三世訪華，國王將「小心考慮」。</summary></entry><entry><title>中式微短劇浪潮席捲英國：為滑動時代而生的「碎片化」劇集</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c50med2zn8dno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T00:20:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c50med2zn8dno/trad--3f37b006923f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c50med2zn8dno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這些節奏明快、張力十足的短篇劇集透過手機觀看，在中國大受歡迎，在英國也正迅速興起。</summary></entry><entry><title>《薩爾達傳說：時之笛》重製版能否重現原作的魔力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62yp24ypz0o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T05:51:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62yp24ypz0o/trad--9a424b14bdc3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62yp24ypz0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">任天堂發布了其重製版，這款遊戲被認為是史上最優秀的遊戲之一。</summary></entry><entry><title>「台灣之光」形象重挫？民眾如何看黃仁勳婚外情風波</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0ey0qx7yo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T04:28:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0ey0qx7yo/trad--897367f353c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0ey0qx7yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達（英偉達）執行長黃仁勳捲入婚外情風波，部分美國媒體引述情報官員指，涉事女子與中國情報系統有關。BBC中文在台北街頭採訪民眾，了解他們如何看待這場仍在持續發醇的風波。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳涉與中國間諜外遇：為何婚外情升溫至國安爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cvwy7ygyw12po/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T12:57:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cvwy7ygyw12po/trad--d48ec9bc38e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cvwy7ygyw12po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達（英偉達，Nvidia）執行長黃仁勳承認婚外情，正接受公司董事會調查，期間維持職務。《紐約時報》報導，美國情報官員認為，與黃仁勳有親密關係的中國商人黃樂（Alice Huang）是中國間諜。美中科技競爭升溫之際，美國對人工智能晶片出口、國家安全及企業管治的討論將更加激烈。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉掀「藍色浪潮」 將怎樣影響世界</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c5vgjjr77wvxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T14:58:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c5vgjjr77wvxo/trad--77bba52040c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c5vgjjr77wvxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在剛剛結束的美國中期選舉中，多個支持共和黨的州「翻藍」，民主黨奪得國會參眾兩院控制權。這次選舉結果為何具有重大意義？又將如何影響美國與世界其他國家的關係？</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒涉「勾結外國勢力」被重判10年 出獄或已40歲</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cjly00z2g03qo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T02:29:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cjly00z2g03qo/trad--f71843834735.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cjly00z2g03qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">上個月剛滿30歲的黃之鋒，自2020年底起因不同案件入獄，至今身在獄中超過六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>政治人物「大改造」？從台灣「九合一」選舉看候選人「形象工程」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c9rkyyzgmy3eo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T11:24:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c9rkyyzgmy3eo/trad--03723852bd6d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c9rkyyzgmy3eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在現代選舉中，形象經營已是不可或缺的一環。隨台灣「九合一」地方選舉將登場，台北市長候選人沈伯洋與蔣萬安的個人形象與公眾人設，也成為選戰攻防話題。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>他們在等西西弗斯：黃之鋒身後，那些寫信和探監的前戰友</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zxz94yzngpo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T05:03:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zxz94yzngpo/trad--d738340ba645.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zxz94yzngpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控違反中國《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力危害國家安全」罪，被判囚10年。BBC中文訪問了三位一直探望並寄信予黃之鋒的前戰友，了解他在獄中的變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>父母選擇「雙人安樂死」，留下我獨自承受喪親之痛</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T06:32:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad--0dd0092810ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">簡和埃爾斯在幸福地生活了50年後，選擇接受安樂死，留下了他們唯一的孩子。</summary></entry><entry><title>間諜、線人與秘密警察：匈牙利公開共產統治時期檔案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd9gnge0ro/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T13:42:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd9gnge0ro/trad--79ad269ffc90.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd9gnge0ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">匈牙利正將其完整的國家安全紀錄檔案庫上載至網上，這些檔案可能揭示在1989年前長達40年的共產主義統治期間，誰曾監視鄰居、同事、朋友和親屬。</summary></entry><entry><title>印尼有毒煙霾正令鄰國陷入政治難題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad--c5c9772ba0f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新加坡和馬來西亞政府正夾在焦慮不安的民眾與脾氣暴躁的鄰國之間。</summary></entry><entry><title>朝鮮「精英」黑客為何成為幣安63億美元盜竊案的頭號嫌犯？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqe8rpl8wjd0o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T07:02:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqe8rpl8wjd0o/trad--d11d069da814.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqe8rpl8wjd0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果有關指控屬實，這宗破紀錄的盜竊案顯示，涉嫌來自朝鮮的黑客如今已擁有多麼強大的能力。</summary></entry><entry><title>從蔡康永、《VIVANT》到姆巴佩，北京為何區別處理「辱華」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T00:21:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad--c99d6f3ad72f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最近幾週，中國輿論場接連出現多宗被貼上「辱華」標籤的爭議事件：台灣藝人蔡康永、日本電視劇《VIVANT》以及法國球星姆巴佩。三宗事件看似性質相近，但官方反應與輿論熱度卻明顯不同，多位分析人士對BBC中文指出：這些差異背後是當局對於每個事件的定性並不相同。</summary></entry><entry><title>美智庫解析「技術民族主義」下的中俄軍工合作細節與限度</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad--3886ce690971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳APEC前夕，中俄「無上限」合有任何挑戰嗎？北京對烏克蘭停火興趣如何？在APEC中美俄三方領袖會面能有所突破？</summary></entry><entry><title>印中關係緩和之際：印邊境官員稱中國軍隊大批集結並搭帳篷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T00:23:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad--c22ccb93b383.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印中關係原本正處於謹慎的復甦階段，直到一位邊境官員的言論引發了人們對實際情況的新疑慮。</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼歐洲各國年輕人走上街頭？背後的共同訴求和暴力隱憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T03:52:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad--af7f5220a503.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">過去一個月，歐洲各地爆發了由青年主導的示威遊行。這些遊行活動有何共同點？</summary></entry><entry><title>武契奇14年執政落幕，中塞「鐵桿友誼」何去何從？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T08:05:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad--bbb377741910.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從總理到總統，武契奇領導的塞爾維亞進步黨（SNS）一步步將塞爾維亞打造成歐洲強硬的親華國家，中國亦曾形容兩國關係為「鐵桿友誼 」。外界關注這一親華總統敗選，將如何改變中塞關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>「短睡眠基因」：為何有人只需睡四小時？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T02:59:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad--f832ffff66be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一般成年人平均需要七至九小時睡眠，但有些人確實只需極少睡眠也能維持良好狀態。</summary></entry><entry><title>Netflix 重現斯坦福監獄「虐待性」研究應該嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T00:21:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad--4c829f30fc85.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Netflix將美國心理學家菲利普·津巴多 (Philip Zimbardo) 1971 年備受爭議的研究改編成了一部六集真人秀，重新引發了一場由來已久的辯論，並引發了關於科學與娛樂之間界限的新問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>愛情、幸運與魔法：年輕人為何找上了網上女巫？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T00:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad--dc4a3ec2e5b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一家網上零售商表示，他們有售有助帶來好運咒語，而最近購買的人數大幅上升。</summary></entry><entry><title>「見鬼了」：為什麼我們會產生超自然體驗？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-01T10:23:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad--39e1c5f76131.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人類講述鬼故事已有數千年歷史，科學的進步並未改變這一點。</summary></entry><entry><title>什麼時候「豪華經濟艙」值得多花錢？來比較2026年全球五強</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T08:27:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad--c7b431e0bccb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球豪經艙排名出來，台灣長榮及阿聯酋航空分佔冠亞軍。</summary></entry></feed>
